# ─── Docker Ignore ───
# Excludes unnecessary files from Docker build context

# Dependencies & build artifacts
**/node_modules
**/.next
**/venv
**/__pycache__
**/.pytest_cache

# IDE & OS
.vscode
.idea
*.swp
*.swo
Thumbs.db
.DS_Store

# Git
.git
.gitignore

# Docs & scripts (not needed in container)
docs/
scripts/
*.md
!README.md

# Env files (passed via docker-compose)
.env
.env.example
.env.local

# Audio files (generated at runtime)
backend/audio/*.mp3
backend/audio/*.wav
